---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { availableItems, displayName, deliverySlabLine, deliveryFreeAboveLineAll } from '../../lib/data';
import { abs, blogPostingJsonLd, breadcrumbJsonLd } from '../../lib/seo';
const headline = 'Plan a Pizza Budget in Sundargarh | The Oven Vibe';
const description = 'Compare actual pizza baskets, pickup and direct-delivery charges at The Oven Vibe without guessed competitor prices or serving promises.';
const path = '/blog/affordable-pizza/';
const image = {url:abs('/static/images/og/blog_1.jpg'),width:1200,height:630,alt:'The Oven Vibe food photograph'};
const examples=[['745802358','997492943'],['745802364','997492919']].map(codes=>codes.map(code=>availableItems.find(i=>i.product_code===code))).filter(rows=>rows.every(Boolean));
---
<Layout title={headline} description={description} ogType="article" image={image} jsonLd={[blogPostingJsonLd({headline,description,path,image:image.url,datePublished:'2024-05-15',dateModified:'2026-10-17'}),breadcrumbJsonLd([{name:'Blog',path:'/blog/'},{name:headline,path}])]}>
 <BlogPostLayout line1='PLAN YOUR' lineGradient='PIZZA BUDGET.' subtitle='Compare the basket you want, including the delivery conditions.'>
  <picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_1.avif"/><source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_1.webp"/><img src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_1.webp" alt="The Oven Vibe food photograph" class="blog-img" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024"/></picture>

  <p>A useful pizza budget starts with the same basket on both sides of the comparison. This is our own kitchen's guide to its direct-order menu, not an independent ranking of Sundargarh restaurants or a current competitor-price survey.</p>
  <h2>Two basket examples from the catalogue</h2>
  <p>These examples show food subtotals only. They do not include delivery, add-ons or applicable surcharges and do not claim to feed a particular number of people.</p>
  <ul>{examples.map(rows=><li>{rows.map(i=>displayName(i!.display_name)).join(' + ')}: <strong>₹{rows.reduce((total,i)=>total+i!.price,0)}</strong>.</li>)}</ul>
  <h2>Combo or individual items?</h2><p>Compare the exact pizza, side size, drink size and quantity. A combo with a different drink is a different basket. The <a href="/choose/#combos">combo comparison</a> lists the current contents and prices without assuming every combination is a saving.</p>
  <h2>Pickup or delivery?</h2><p>Pickup avoids the delivery and rain charge. During the late-night window it still includes the kitchen reopen charge. Direct delivery uses these standard distance rates: {deliverySlabLine}. {deliveryFreeAboveLineAll} during normal hours; free delivery does not apply late at night.</p>
  <h2>A simple comparison method</h2><ol><li>Write down the items and sizes you actually want.</li><li>Compare that exact basket, including extras, on the website or chosen app.</li><li>Add the displayed delivery fees and applicable conditions.</li><li>Choose based on the final total and the ingredients you want, rather than a percentage-off headline.</li></ol>
  <p>For a birthday or office order, ask for a written quote with the date, time, headcount and delivery address. Do not multiply an example basket into a per-person package without confirming quantities.</p>

  <p><a href="/choose/">Compare ingredients, serving sizes and combos</a>, <a href="/menu/">browse the full menu</a>, or <a href="/faq/">read the ordering answers</a>.</p>
 </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
